    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesn't feel like a new direction though. it just feels heavy. like i'm standing at the edge of a cliff and the wind is pushing me, and honestly, it feels more peaceful to just stop fighting the wind. like the only way to find any quiet is to just let go of the path entirely.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
